    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41440" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rĕ-sum</span></b>  = resideo, assumed as <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>pres.</i> for the
